# Change: shop rework. Top teams buy Treasure shards early, then Bruiser (Power Strength).
# The old split over four different shard types delayed every emblem, since 5 identical
# shards are needed for one. Now all gold goes to a single shard type:
#   - Treasure Strength before round 500,
#   - Bruiser Strength after that.
# The altar lock is also dropped (locks show no effect in ladder games). That saves 10 gold
# and the fuel spent on lock logic.

BANK_BAG = 15
BANK_NEAR_BAG = 10
BANK_ETA = 3

def cast_on(slot, u):
